    "body": "## Motivation\n\nFixes #44535.\n\nWhen `stop_token_ids` contains token IDs outside `[0, vocab_size)` (e.g. negative numbers or IDs >= `vocab_size`), `BatchedMinNewTokensPenalizer._prepare` in `penaltylib/min_new_tokens.py` executes `scatter_add_` on a `[batch, vocab_size + 1]` CUDA tensor. An out-of-range token ID triggers an out-of-bounds assert in PyTorch CUDA kernels (`idx_dim >= 0 && idx_dim < index_size`), crashing the server and terminating all in-flight requests.\n\nWhile `SamplingParams.verify()` validates `logit_bias` keys against `vocab_size`, `stop_token_ids` was previously unchecked.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Added bounds verification in `SamplingParams.verify()` (`python/sglang/srt/sampling/sampling_params.py`) to validate that every entry in `self.stop_token_ids` satisfies `0 <= token_id < vocab_size`, raising `ValueError` (HTTP 400) early if violated.\n- Added comprehensive unit tests in `test/registered/unit/sampling/test_sampling_params.py` covering out-of-vocab token IDs, negative token IDs, and valid tokens within range.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nN/A (input validation fix).\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nN/A (negligible pre-flight scalar check).\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38805469968](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38805469968)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38805469749](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38805469749)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38805469601](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38805469601)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\n",
